      "content": "hey, just saw the breaking news about the regulatory probe into solarix corp and the massive fine they're facing. this looks huge... if this hits the wider market, my entire portfolio is gonna tank. as my wealth manager, i need your honest take: how much of a hit are we actually looking at here? can we weather this or should i pull my funds out now?",
